  "result": "Perfect! All 206 tests pass. The credit notes feature is complete.\n\n**What was implemented:**\n- Added `createCreditNote(invoice, { amount, reason, date }, existingNumbers)` to new src/credits.js\n- Creates refund credit notes for issued, partially_paid, or paid invoices\n- Returns ok(creditNote) with: { number, invoiceNumber, customerId, amount, reason, date }\n- Credit note numbers in CN-YYYY-NNNN format with separate counter from invoices\n- Error handling:\n  - NOT_ISSUED if invoice is draft\n  - AMOUNT_INVALID if amount isn't a positive integer\n  - CREDIT_TOO_HIGH if amount exceeds invoice total\n- Added `nextCreditNoteNumber(existingNumbers, date)` helper that:\n  - Generates CN-prefixed numbers with separate year counters\n  - Correctly filters mixed invoice/credit note numbers\n  - Resets counter per year\n\n**Test coverage includes:**\n- Credit note creation for all valid invoice statuses\n- Proper credit note numbering and format\n- NOT_ISSUED rejection for drafts\n- Amount validation (positive integers only)\n- CREDIT_TOO_HIGH rejection for excessive amounts\n- Allowing full invoice total credit notes\n- Sequential number generation\n- Year boundary handling for credit notes\n- Mixed number filtering (ignores INV numbers)\n- Complex invoices with discounts and VAT\n- Unordered number handling\n\nAll 206 tests pass (187 previous + 19 new).",
